    "**That it Basil!Wait...with Gradyrat?**": {
        "chi": "**那是巴吉尔!等等...和格拉迪亚特?**"
    },
    "**You can't defeat it...**": {
        "chi": "**你们守不住的...**"
    },
    "**It's an image of Basil...**": {
        "chi": "**那是巴吉尔的幻象...**"
    },
    "**We have to hurry up,let's move**": {
        "chi": "**我们得快点了 我们走**"
    },
    "**Now we're in the Evernight Temple**": {
        "chi": "**我们现在在永夜神殿里**"
    },
    "**The instrument shows that the fragment is over our heads**": {
        "chi": "**设备显示微光之碎片在我们的上方**"
    },
    "**In order to prevent invaders**": {
        "chi": "**为了防止入侵者**"
    },
    "**there're many seal doors**": {
        "chi": "**这里有许多被封锁的门**"
    },
    "**The core must be...wait**": {
        "chi": "**那一定是核心...等一下**"
    },
    "**there is something has been wakened!**": {
        "chi": "**有什么东西被唤醒了!**"
    },
    "'I'm the watcher of the temple'": {
        "chi": "'我是神殿的监视者'"
    },
    "'and the keeper of the Glimmer Fragment'": {
        "chi": "'和微光之碎片的守卫者'"
    },
    "'You,the greedy thieves of humankind'": {
        "chi": "'你,是贪婪的小偷'"
    },
    "'Now face me and feel my wrath!'": {
        "chi": "'现在面对我的怒火吧!'"
    },
    "**It's the watcher system of the temple!**": {
        "chi": "**它是神殿的监视者系统!**"
    },
    "**Ready for battle!**": {
        "chi": "**准备战斗!**"
    },
    "**Make it stop before it kill us all!**": {
        "chi": "**在它杀了我们杀了它!**"
    },
    "**Static Shock - crouch **": {
        "chi": "**闪电冲击 - 蹲下 **"
    },
    "**Burning Field**": {
        "chi": "**燃烧领域(随机出现火场)**"
    },
    "**The watcher is absorbing other additional cores!**": {
        "chi": "**监视者正在吸收其他核心!**"
    },
    "**get close to the middle of field**": {
        "chi": "**靠近场地中间**"
    },
    "**Ember Tornado**": {
        "chi": "**火焰飓风之推力**"
    },
    "**Chaosbreak**": {
        "chi": "**混乱毁灭(准备对BOSS按W)**"
    },
    "**Absolute Vacuum**": {
        "chi": "**绝对真空之引力(按S)**"
    },
    "**Sidewind**": {
        "chi": "**侧风**"
    },
    "**Celestial Smash - Go side**": {
        "chi": "**天神粉碎 - 远离闪电去边缘白线**"
    },
    "**Aurora Shield - The Watcher is transform the damage we have done to it into healing,use the Thunder Magick to smash the shiel": {
        "chi": "**极光领域 - 监视者正在转化我们的伤害来治疗自己,使用闪电魔法打碎领域"
    },
    "**Warning!**": {
        "chi": "**警告!**"
    },
    "**Power is nearly to critical value!**": {
        "chi": "**能量已到达临界值!**"
    },
    "**He is casting his last attack!**": {
        "chi": "**它在准备最后一击!**"
    },
    "**It's our last chance!**": {
        "chi": "**这是我们最后的机会!**"
    },
    "**We defeat it**": {
        "chi": "**我们打败了它**"
    },
    "**Just hold for a while,we need a little time to light up the core**": {
        "chi": "**稍等一下,我们需要一点时间启动核心**"
    },
    "**We have lit up the core successfully,keep defending till the core lift move upwards**": {
        "chi": "**我们已经成功启动核心 守住直到电梯上升**"
    },
    "**This is our last hold**": {
        "chi": "**这是我们最后的防守**"
    },
    "**Nicely done**": {
        "chi": "**干得漂亮**"
    },
    "**Hold the position till the gate open**": {
        "chi": "**守住这里直到我们打开大门**"
    },
    "**There're two invisible walls**": {
        "chi": "**有两个隐形的墙**"
    },
    "**try to find a way to break through**": {
        "chi": "**找个办法打破它**"
    },
    "**Act II complete**": {
        "chi": "**Act II 完成 **"
    },
    "**First go to right**": {
        "chi": "**我们先走右边**"
    },
    "**Freezing Breath**": {
        "chi": "**寒冰呼吸**"
    },
    "**Meltdown - Silence human magick for 30 seconds (except for the Light Magick)**": {
        "chi": "**核心熔毁 - 沉默人类神器30秒 (光魔法除外)**"
    },
    "**Lightning Storm**": {
        "chi": "**闪电风暴**"
    },
    "**Blizzard**": {
        "chi": "**暴风雪**"
    },
    "**Act III complete**": {
        "chi": "**Act III 完成 **"
    },
    "**Next act coming soon**": {
        "chi": "**下一章节将在不久后到来**"
    },
    "**Watch out!zombies are climbing the wall!**": {
        "chi": "**小心!僵尸们正在爬墙!**"
    },
    "**There is no way to reach the other side**": {
        "chi": "**这里没有路去对面**"
    },
    "**Maybe we could get some aids from the building?**": {
        "chi": "**也许我们可以从建筑里得到一些帮助?**"
    },
    "**The sluice activated**": {
        "chi": "**闸门已启动**"
    },
    "**Hold here till the water rises**": {
        "chi": "**守住直到水面上升**"
    },
    "**Very luck,it seems the Watcher system is broken here**": {
        "chi": "**很幸运,看起来监视者的系统坏掉了**"
    },
    "**We need a little time to light the core**": {
        "chi": "**我们需要一点时间启动核心**"
    },
    "**OK,let's go**": {
        "chi": "**好,我们走**"
    },
    "**It seems that we are in the ancient drainage of the temple**": {
        "chi": "**看起来我们在神殿的老旧下水道里**"
    },
    "**Try to find a way to get the next core**": {
        "chi": "**找一条路去下一个核心**"
    },
    "**Woe are us!The temple must needs a refurbishment!**": {
        "chi": "**这座神殿需要翻新一下了!**"
    },
    "**There is no way...**": {
        "chi": "**这里没有路...**"
    },
    "**We have no option but to through the waterway under our feet**": {
        "chi": "**我们别无选择，只能通过脚下的水道**"
    },
    "**We must turn on the three switches to get through**": {
        "chi": "**我们必须打开三个开关才能通过**"
    },
    "**We have lit up one of the cores successfully**": {
        "chi": "**我们成功地启动了一个核心**"
    },
    "**Now we need go to left and light up the other one**": {
        "chi": "**现在我们需要去左边启动另一个**"
    },
    "**Hold on,we are going to get the air**": {
        "chi": "**守住,我们需要呼吸一下空气**"
    },
    "**Damn!Gradyrat is there!**": {
        "chi": "**妈的!格拉迪亚特在这!**"
    },
    "**It must be summoned by Basil!**": {
        "chi": "**它一定是被巴吉尔召唤来的!**"
    },
    "**he want a checkmate in this move!**": {
        "chi": "**它想在这里杀死我们!**"
    },
    "**No time to waste,defeat it or be killed by it!**": {
        "chi": "**不要浪费时间了,打败他否则它会杀了我们!**"
    },
    "**Prepare to fight!**": {
        "chi": "**准备战斗!**"
    },
    "**Crystal Blast**": {
        "chi": "**水晶爆破(远离BOSS)**"
    },
    "**Dark Subside**": {
        "chi": "**黑暗退散(蹲下移动躲避头顶)**"
    },
    "**Poison Cloud**": {
        "chi": "**剧毒之云(远离BOSS后面)**"
    },
    "**It's the control station of 'the Watcher' system!**": {
        "chi": "**这里是监视者的控制系统!**"
    },
    "**Maybe we can use it to attack Gradyrat?**": {
        "chi": "**也许我们可以用它去攻击格拉迪亚特?**"
    },
    "**Spitacid**": {
        "chi": "**强酸溅射(远离BOSS正面)**"
    },
    "**Icicle Prod**": {
        "chi": "**冰霜之刺(躲避脚下的攻击)**"
    },
    "**Curse of Weakness**": {
        "chi": "**虚弱之诅咒(远离BOSS)**"
    },
    "**We don't have much time!**": {
        "chi": "**我们没时间了!**"
    },
    "**Defeat it as quickly as possible!**": {
        "chi": "**尽可能快的打败它!**"
    },
